00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:23,480
of the problems is, is that there's counterparty risk.

295
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,480
You are a rice merchant.

296
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,480
You make a deal with a warehouse.

297
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,480
You have a contract.

